Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:08:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis: status page closer to the public
 mock: folds, rail, pointer, counts in words

The agents, the other teams and the datasets sit in closed folds under a count line; the heartbeat is a right rail from 1100 px and above the cards on a phone; a one-line pointer says where answers go (no link, no id); the bare summary numbers are gone (counts are sentences); the sentence under the title is the design's.

Agent: cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis
Issue: WS-14
For: Dinis
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
